{
  "account": "plur",
  "background": { "color": "#0A0A0A" },
  "slides": [
    {
      "type": "cover",
      "main": ["6 SECONDS"],
      "sub": "The drum break that built a century."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Washington D.C. 1969.",
        "A soul group called The Winstons.",
        "Their hit single: 'Color Him Father'.",
        "The B-side: 'Amen, Brother'.",
        "Nobody listened to the B-side."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "February 1970.",
        "'Color Him Father' wins the Grammy.",
        "Best R&B Song.",
        "The B-side stays in the dark.",
        "Gregory Coleman's break — unheard."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1 min 26 sec into 'Amen, Brother'.",
        "The instruments stop.",
        "Coleman plays alone.",
        "Four bars.",
        "Six seconds.",
        "He doesn't know what he is making."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "1988. America hears it first.",
        "NWA — 'Straight Outta Compton'.",
        "Rob Base & DJ E-Z Rock.",
        "Hip-hop finds the break.",
        "The Amen starts to move."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "Early 90s. London.",
        "4hero. Reinforced Records. Shy FX.",
        "Pitch it up. Chop it. Resequence.",
        "160 BPM. 170 BPM.",
        "The Amen becomes the engine",
        "of jungle. Then drum and bass."
      ],
      "sub": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "Gregory Coleman",
        "died in Atlanta, 2006.",
        "Homeless.",
        "Zero royalties.",
        "From over 5,000 songs.",
        "The most sampled drummer in history",
        "never knew."
      ],
      "note": "His name is not in the credits."
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "Everything you've heard —",
        "jungle, DnB, breakcore —",
        "started here.",
        "Six seconds.",
        "A B-side.",
        "A man who died not knowing."
      ],
      "strobe": "",
      "cta": "Save this."
    }
  ]
}
